                "Tantalate-Lode TL-HIL has sodium-reduction retort RT-2 rattling at 48 pps on the "
                "electrode puck, well above a 12 pps quiet band. Coil CT remains 38 kA under 52 and "
                "would have authorized a 12 MW slip if AE had lost the race. Holding the slip is the "
                "only legal gate; mock-pit amps do not license a growling sodium-reducer electrode.",